 feast of parallels for the digital age","og_description":"Happy Bitcoin Pizza Day! Today, we celebrate Laszlo Hanyecz\u2019 historic bitcoin-for-pizza transaction \u2013 the first time bitcoins were used as currency in exchange for real-world goods. You can read Laszlo&#8217;s original bitcoin-for-pizza bitcointalk.org forum post here. This year, instead of focusing on Laszlo&#8217;s mindboggling opportunity cost (yes, those 10,000 bitcoins are worth about $700M today), [&hellip;]","og_url":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/crypto-education\/bitcoin-pizza-day-2024","og_site_name":"Kraken Blog","article_published_time":"2024-05-22T13:51:27+00:00","article_modified_time":"2024-05-22T14:25:36+00:00","og_image":[{"width":1024,"height":512,"url":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/Carousel-Self-custody-best-practices-1024x512.png","type":"image\/png"}],"author":"KrakenFX","twitter_card":"summary_large_image","twitter_misc":{"Written by":"KrakenFX","Est. reading time":"4 minutes"},"schema":{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"Article","@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/crypto-education\/bitcoin-pizza-day-2024#article","isPartOf":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/crypto-education\/bitcoin-pizza-day-2024"},"author":{"name":"KrakenFX","@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/#\/schema\/person\/87e55a5e8ea020a6e620192589a05abf"},"headline":"Bitcoin and pizza: A feast of parallels for the digital age","datePublished":"2024-05-22T13:51:27+00:00","dateModified":"2024-05-22T14:25:36+00:00","mainEntityOfPage":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/crypto-education\/bitcoin-pizza-day-2024"},"wordCount":682,"commentCount":0,"publisher":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/#organization"},"image":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/crypto-education\/bitcoin-pizza-day-2024#primaryimage"},"thumbnailUrl":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/Carousel-Self-custody-best-practices.png?fit=2946%2C1472&ssl=1","keywords":["featured","Krake